PACK trip 1
RESIDENT Trip
-- A Trip is the record of ONE kill (operator, 2026-11-12: record only the kills, never timings): the engine writes
-- `Trip:<eid>#<prop>` {node, self_ms, allowance_ms, at, active} when a getter evaluation passes its self-time allowance. The node
-- is that reasoned null while `active` (until one of its inputs changes). The class is declared here so the host mirrors it.
Trip.reason getter: 'timeout ' + str(this.self_ms) + ' ms (allowance ' + str(this.allowance_ms) + ' ms)'
